UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `Text` = 'The quarry will be fine thanks to you.$B$BThink I''ll let some o'' the boys take a little vacation...$B$BHAH! Who am I kiddin''? I almost said that with a straight face, too.$B$BWe got WORK to do!' WHERE `Id` = 58576;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `Text` = 'Ain''t much to it!$B$BThere are five rare treasures that you can find in the Dark Soil around Pandaria: Ruby Shards, Lovely Apples, Jade Cats, Blue Feathers, and Marsh Lilies.$B$BAs long as you have one of those items in your bags, you''ll see who around here is willing to accept them.$B$BFind one of those and give them to someone you like, and chances are they''ll like you a little back! Everyone has a favorite item out of the five, so talk to folks to learn what they prefer.$B$BAlso, the folks ''round here love food! I mean, who doesn''t? If you know how to cook, you might just profit!$B$BThat''s about all I know about gifts. Good luck!' WHERE `Id` = 58602;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `Text` = 'I''ve got backup. Watch this.' WHERE `Id` = 58609;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `Text` = 'Howdy, stranger!' WHERE `Id` = 58667;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `Text` = 'My pappy must''ve told me the story a hunnert times!$B$BBack during the great drought, times sure were hard. Farmers were spitting on their crops to water ''em, it was so dry. The entire town was starvin'' o'' thirst!$B$BSo what does Farmer Yoon''s grandpappy do but pack up his wagon in the middle o'' the night.$B$BThen he drives his mushan beast all the way to the lake at the base o'' Kun-Lai Summit. He loads up that wagon with a hunnert barrels o'' fresh water, then drives right on back.$B$BHe didn''t stop fer nuthin''! How could he? Our whole town was dyin''! He drove that busted wagon up to his farm and his mushan died on the spot!$B$BBut we had enough water for the entire town and the spring harvest, too.$B$BSaved Halfhill, Yoon''s grandpappy did!' WHERE `Id` = 58669;
UPDATE `broadcast_text` SET `Text` = 'I''ll collect my tools and meet you at Farmer Yoon''s. Bet I can beat you there!' WHERE `Id` = 58670;
